# Jean de Brebeuf joins: FUN_4345_0342 case 0x16 sets bit 0x10 (Jesuit grade) on every mission whose
# low nibble is the electing nation.
# Start: turns_pioneer_jobs_complete's output (France, Spring 1601, turn 110; England at peace,
# every French map unit fortified, the Europe-bound Caravel held at sea). Fixture (sav_json): France
# liberty_bells_pool = 1000 (threshold 1009 with 5 fathers; the turn's bells cross it) and next_founding_father = 22.
# Covers: French plain missions in villages 7, 61, 68 go 1 -> 17; the French Jesuit mission (village 10,
